son with AOT source generators for JSON scenarios."},"features":{"zh":["基于模式的序列化格式（Protobuf、MessagePack）","反射式序列化格式（Newtonsoft.Json）","System.Text.Json与AOT源代码生成器","提高.NET应用性能","选择合适的序列化格式","JSON场景的优化"],"ja":["スキーマベースのシリアル化形式（Protobuf、MessagePack）","リフレクションベースのシリアル化形式（Newtonsoft.Json）","System.Text.JsonとAOTソースコード生成器",".NETアプリケーションのパフォーマンスの向上","適切なシリアル化形式の選択","JSONシナリオの最適化"],"ko":["스키마 기반 직렬화 형식（Protobuf、MessagePack）","리플렉션 기반 직렬화 형식（Newtonsoft.Json）","System.Text.Json와 AOT 소스 코드 생성기",".NET 응용 프로그램의 성능 향상","적합한 직렬화 형식의 선택","JSON 시나리오의 최적화"],"es":["Formatos de serialización basados en esquemas","Uso de System.Text.Json con generadores de código AOT","Compatibilidad con Protobuf y MessagePack","Mejora del rendimiento de la aplicación","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Formats de sérialisation basés sur des schémas","Utilisation de System.Text.Json avec des générateurs de code AOT","Compatibilité avec Protobuf et MessagePack","Amélioration des performances de l''application","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Schemabasierte Serialisierungsformate","Verwendung von System.Text.Json mit AOT-Code-Generatoren","Kompatibilität mit Protobuf und MessagePack","Leistungsverbesserung der Anwendung","Einfache Bedienung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Escolha do formato de serialização certo","Uso de formatos baseados em esquema","Melhor desempenho com Protobuf e MessagePack","Uso de System.Text.Json com AOT source generators","Suporte a JSON com System.Text.Json"],"ru":["Выбор правильного формата сериализации","Использование форматов на основе схем","Лучшая производительность с Protobuf и MessagePack","Использование System.Text.Json с AOT source generators","Поддержка JSON с System.Text.Json"],"ar":["اختيار الصيغة المناسبة للترميز","استخدام الصيغ القائمة على مخطط","أداء أفضل مع Protobuf و MessagePack","استخدام System.Text.Json مع AOT source generators","دعم JSON مع System.Text.Json"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何选择合适的序列化格式","什么是序列化","Protobuf与Newtonsoft.Json的比较","System.Text.Json安装","JSON序列化的优化","提高.NET应用性能的方法","AI智能代理工具","AI智能代理的应用"],"ja":["適切なシリアル化形式の選択方法","シリアル化とは何か","ProtobufとNewtonsoft.Jsonの比較","System.Text.Jsonのインストール","JSONシリアル化の最適化",".NETアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させる方法","AIエージェントツール","AIエージェントの応用"],"ko":["적합한 직렬화 형식을 선택하는 방법","직렬화란 무엇인가","Protobuf와 Newtonsoft.Json의 비교","System.Text.Json 설치","JSON 직렬화의 최적화",".NET 응용 프로그램의 성능을 향상시키는 방법","AI 에이전트 도구","AI 에이전트의 응용"],"es":["cómo usar serialización en .NET","qué es la serialización","alternativas a Newtonsoft.Json","serialización vs deserialización","instalación de System.Text.Json","guía de configuración de Protobuf","mejores prácticas de serialización para .NET"],"fr":["comment utiliser la sérialisation dans .NET","qu''est-ce que la sérialisation","alternatives à Newtonsoft.Json","sérialisation vs désérialisation","installation de System.Text.Json","guide de configuration de Protobuf","meilleures pratiques de sérialisation pour .NET"],"de":["wie man Serialisierung in .NET verwendet","was ist Serialisierung","Alternativen zu Newtonsoft.Json","Serialisierung vs Deserialisierung","Installation von System.Text.Json","Konfigurationsanleitung für Protobuf","beste Praktiken für Serialisierung in .NET"],"pt":["serialização .NET","formatos de serialização","Protobuf vs Newtonsoft.Json","como usar System.Text.Json","melhor formato de serialização para .NET","alternativas para Newtonsoft.Json","guia de instalação do Protobuf","configuração do MessagePack"],"ru":["сериализация .NET","форматы сериализации","Protobuf vs Newtonsoft.Json","как использовать System.Text.Json","лучший формат сериализации для .NET","альтернативы для Newtonsoft.Json","гид по установке Protobuf","настройка MessagePack"],"ar":["الترميز .NET","صيغ الترميز","Protobuf vs Newtonsoft.Json","كيفية استخدام System.Text.Json","أفضل صيغة ترميز لل .NET","بديلات ل Newtonsoft.Json","دليل تثبيت Protobuf","إعدادات MessagePack"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"serialization","description":"Choose the right serialization format for .NET applications. Prefer schema-based formats (Protobuf, MessagePack) over reflection-based (Newtonsoft.Json). Use System.Text.Json with AOT source generators for JSON scenarios.","bodyPreview":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack,","body":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack, System.Text.Json (source gen) | Newtonsoft.Json, BinaryFormatter |\n| **Type info in payload** | No (external schema) | Yes (type names embedded) |\n| **Versioning** | Explicit field numbers/names | Implicit (type structure) |\n| **Performance** | Fast (no reflection) | Slower (runtime reflection) |\n| **AOT compatible** | Yes | No |\n| **Wire compatibility** | Excellent | Poor |\n\n**Recommendation**: Use schema-based serialization for anything that crosses process boundaries.\n\n---\n\n## Format Recommendations\n\n| Use Case | Recommended Format | Why |\n|----------|-------------------|-----|\n| **REST APIs** | System.Text.Json (source gen) | Standard, AOT-compatible |\n| **gRPC** | Protocol Buffers | Native format, excellent versioning |\n| **Actor messaging** | MessagePack or Protobuf | Compact, fast, version-safe |\n| **Event sourcing** | Protobuf or MessagePack | Must handle old events forever |\n| **Caching** | MessagePack | Compact, fast |\n| **Configuration** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Human-readable |\n| **Logging** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Structured, parseable |\n\n### Formats to Avoid\n\n| Format | Problem |\n|--------|---------|\n| **BinaryFormatter** | Security vulnerabilities, deprecated, never use |\n| **Newtonsoft.Json default** | Type names in payload break on rename |\n| **DataContractSerializer** | Complex, poor versioning |\n| **XML** | Verbose, slow, complex |\n\n---\n\n## System.Text.Json with Source Generators\n\nFor JSON serialization, use System.Text.Json with source generators for AOT compatibility and performance.\n\n### Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Define a JsonSerializerContext with all your types\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(OrderItem))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Customer))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(List<Order>))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.CamelCase,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Usage\n\n```csharp\n// Serialize with context\nvar json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(order, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Deserialize with context\nvar order = JsonSerializer.Deserialize(json, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Configure in ASP.NET Core\nbuilder.Services.ConfigureHttpJsonOptions(options =>\n{\n    options.SerializerOptions.TypeInfoResolverChain.Insert(0, AppJsonContext.Default);\n});\n```\n\n### Benefits\n\n- **No reflection at runtime** - All type info generated at compile time\n- **AOT compatible** - Works with Native AOT publishing\n- **Faster** - No runtime type analysis\n- **Trim-safe** - Linker knows exactly what''s needed\n\n---\n\n## Protocol Buffers (Protobuf)\n\nBest for: Actor systems, gRPC, event sourcing, any long-lived wire format.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Google.Protobuf\ndotnet add package Grpc.Tools\n```\n\n### Define Schema\n\n```protobuf\n// orders.proto\nsyntax = \"proto3\";\n\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    repeated OrderItem items = 3;\n    int64 created_at_ticks = 4;\n\n    // Adding new fields is always safe\n    string notes = 5;  // Added in v2 - old readers ignore it\n}\n\nmessage OrderItem {\n    string product_id = 1;\n    int32 quantity = 2;\n    int64 price_cents = 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Versioning Rules\n\n```protobuf\n// SAFE: Add new fields with new numbers\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    string shipping_address = 5;  // NEW - safe\n}\n\n// SAFE: Remove fields (old readers ignore unknown, new readers use default)\n// Just stop using the field, keep the number reserved\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    // customer_id removed, but field 2 is reserved\n    reserved 2;\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Change field types\nmessage Order {\n    int32 id = 1;  // Was: string - BREAKS!\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Reuse field numbers\nmessage Order {\n    reserved 2;\n    string new_field = 2;  // Reusing 2 - BREAKS!\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## MessagePack\n\nBest for: High-performance scenarios, compact payloads, actor messaging.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package MessagePack\ndotnet add package MessagePack.Annotations\n```\n\n### Usage with Contracts\n\n```csharp\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic sealed class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)]\n    public required string Id { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(1)]\n    public required string CustomerId { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(2)]\n    public required IReadOnlyList<OrderItem> Items { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(3)]\n    public required DateTimeOffset CreatedAt { get; init; }\n\n    // New field - old readers skip unknown keys\n    [Key(4)]\n    public string? Notes { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Serialize\nvar bytes = MessagePackSerializer.Serialize(order);\n\n// Deserialize\nvar order = MessagePackSerializer.Deserialize<Order>(bytes);\n```\n\n### AOT-Compatible Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generator for AOT\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic partial class Order { }  // partial enables source gen\n\n// Configure resolver\nvar options = MessagePackSerializerOptions.Standard\n    .WithResolver(CompositeResolver.Create(\n        GeneratedResolver.Instance,  // Generated\n        StandardResolver.Instance));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Newtonsoft | System.Text.Json | Fix |\n|------------|------------------|-----|\n| `$type` in JSON | Not supported by default | Use discriminators or custom converters |\n| `JsonProperty` | `JsonPropertyName` | Different attribute |\n| `DefaultValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| `NullValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| Private setters | Requires `[JsonInclude]` | Explicit opt-in |\n| Polymorphism | `[JsonDerivedType]` (.NET 7+) | Explicit discriminators |\n\n### Migration Pattern\n\n```csharp\n// Newtonsoft (reflection-based)\npublic class Order\n{\n    [JsonProperty(\"order_id\")]\n    public string Id { get; set; }\n\n    [JsonProperty(NullValueHandling = NullValueHandling.Ignore)]\n    public string? Notes { get; set; }\n}\n\n// System.Text.Json (source-gen compatible)\npublic sealed record Order(\n    [property: JsonPropertyName(\"order_id\")]\n    string Id,\n\n    string? Notes  // Null handling via JsonSerializerOptions\n);\n\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.SnakeCaseLower,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class OrderJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Polymorphism with Discriminators\n\n```csharp\n// .NET 7+ polymorphism\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(CreditCardPayment), \"credit_card\")]\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(BankTransferPayment), \"bank_transfer\")]\npublic abstract record Payment(decimal Amount);\n\npublic sealed record CreditCardPayment(decimal Amount, string Last4) : Payment(Amount);\npublic sealed record BankTransferPayment(decimal Amount, string AccountNumber) : Payment(Amount);\n\n// Serializes as:\n// { \"$type\": \"credit_card\", \"amount\": 100, \"last4\": \"1234\" }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Wire Compatibility Patterns\n\n### Tolerant Reader\n\nOld code must safely ignore unknown fields:\n\n```csharp\n// Protobuf/MessagePack: Automatic - unknown fields skipped\n// System.Text.Json: Configure to allow\nvar options = new JsonSerializerOptions\n{\n    UnmappedMemberHandling = JsonUnmappedMemberHandling.Skip\n};\n```\n\n### Introduce Read Before Write\n\nDeploy deserializers before serializers for new formats:\n\n```csharp\n// Phase 1: Add deserializer (deployed everywhere)\npublic Order Deserialize(byte[] data, string manifest) => manifest switch\n{\n    \"Order.V1\" => DeserializeV1(data),\n    \"Order.V2\" => DeserializeV2(data),  // NEW - can read V2\n    _ => throw new NotSupportedException()\n};\n\n// Phase 2: Enable serializer (next release, after V1 deployed everywhere)\npublic (byte[] data, string manifest) Serialize(Order order) =>\n    _useV2Format\n        ? (SerializeV2(order), \"Order.V2\")\n        : (SerializeV1(order), \"Order.V1\");\n```\n\n### Never Embed Type Names\n\n```csharp\n// BAD: Type name in payload - renaming class breaks wire format\n{\n    \"$type\": \"MyApp.Order, MyApp.Core\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n\n// GOOD: Explicit discriminator - refactoring safe\n{\n    \"type\": \"order\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Comparison\n\nApproximate throughput (higher is better):\n\n| Format | Serialize | Deserialize | Size |\n|--------|-----------|-------------|------|\n| MessagePack | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| Protobuf | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| System.Text.Json (source gen) | ★★★★☆ | ★★★★☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| System.Text.Json (reflection) | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| Newtonsoft.Json | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n\nFor hot paths, prefer MessagePack or Protobuf.\n\n---\n\n## Akka.NET Serialization\n\nFor Akka.NET actor systems, use schema-based serialization:\n\n```hocon\nakka {\n  actor {\n    serializers {\n      messagepack = \"Akka.Serialization.MessagePackSerializer, Akka.Serialization.MessagePack\"\n    }\n    serialization-bindings {\n      \"MyApp.Messages.IMessage, MyApp\" = messagepack\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee [Akka.NET Serialization Docs](https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html).\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generators for System.Text.Json\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n\n// Use explicit field numbers/keys\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)] public string Id { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Use records for immutable message types\npublic sealed record OrderCreated(OrderId Id, CustomerId CustomerId);\n```\n\n### DON''T\n\n```csharp\n// Don''t use BinaryFormatter (ever)\nvar formatter = new BinaryFormatter();  // Security risk!\n\n// Don''t embed type names in wire format\nsettings.TypeNameHandling = TypeNameHandling.All;  // Breaks on rename!\n\n// Don''t use reflection serialization for hot paths\nJsonConvert.SerializeObject(order);  // Slow, not AOT-compatible\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **System.Text.Json Source Generation**: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/serialization/system-text-json/source-generation\n- **Protocol Buffers**: https://protobuf.dev/\n- **MessagePack-CSharp**: https://github.com/MessagePack-CSharp/MessagePack-CSharp\n- **Akka.NET Serialization**: https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html\n- **Wire Compatibility**: https://getakka.net/community/contributing/wire-compatibility.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T09:49:43.993Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for .NET Agents requiring efficient data serialization and deserialization using schema-based formats like Protobuf and MessagePack.","zh":"适用于需要使用基于模式的格式（如 Protobuf 和 MessagePack）进行高效数据序列化和反序列化的 .NET Agents。","ja":".NET Agents が Protobuf や MessagePack などのスキーマベースの形式を使用して効率的なデータのシリアル化とデシリアル化を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Protobuf 및 MessagePack와 같은 스키마 기반 형식을 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 직렬화 및 역직렬화를 요구하는 .NET 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes .NET que requieren una serialización y deserialización de datos eficientes utilizando formatos basados en esquemas como Protobuf y MessagePack.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents .NET nécessitant une sérialisation et une désérialisation de données efficaces à l''aide de formats basés sur des schémas tels que Protobuf et MessagePack.","de":"Ideal für .NET-Agents, die eine effiziente Daten-Serialisierung und -Deserialisierung unter Verwendung von schema-basierten Formaten wie Protobuf und MessagePack erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes .NET que exigem uma serialização e desserialização de dados eficientes usando formatos baseados em esquemas como Protobuf e MessagePack.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов .NET, требующих эффективной сериализации и десериализации данных с использованием форматов на основе схем, таких как Protobuf и MessagePack.","ar":"مثالي لعميل .NET الذي يتطلب ترميز وترجمة بيانات فعالين باستخدام تنسيقات قائمة على مخطط مثل Protobuf و MessagePack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to choose the right serialization format for .NET applications, leveraging System.Text.Json with AOT source generators for high-performance JSON scenarios and optimizing serialization performance with schema-based formats.","zh":"赋予代理选择 .NET 应用程序的正确序列化格式的能力，利用 System.Text.Json 和 AOT 源代码生成器以实现高性能的 JSON 场景，并通过基于模式的格式优化序列化性能。","ja":"エージェントが .NET アプリケーションの適切なシリアル化形式を選択する能力を付与し、System.Text.Json と AOT ソース ジェネレーターを使用して高パフォーマンスの JSON シナリオを実現し、スキーマベースの形式でシリアル化パフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":".NET 애플리케이션을 위한 적절한 직렬화 형식을 에이전트가 선택할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며 System.Text.Json 및 AOT 소스 생성기를 사용하여 고성능 JSON 시나리오를 구현하고 스키마 기반 형식으로 직렬화 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a elegir el formato de serialización adecuado para las aplicaciones .NET, aprovechando System.Text.Json con generadores de código AOT para escenarios de alto rendimiento JSON y optimizando el rendimiento de la serialización con formatos basados en esquemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de choisir le bon format de sérialisation pour les applications .NET, en exploitant System.Text.Json avec des générateurs de code AOT pour des scénarios JSON à haute performance et en optimisant les performances de sérialisation avec des formats basés sur des schémas.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, das richtige Serialisierungsformat für .NET-Anwendungen auszuwählen, indem System.Text.Json mit AOT-Quellgeneratoren für Hochleistungs-JSON-Szenarien genutzt wird und die Serialisierungsleistung mit schema-basierten Formaten optimiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escolher o formato de serialização correto para aplicações .NET, aproveitando o System.Text.Json com geradores de fonte AOT para cenários de alto desempenho JSON e otimizando o desempenho de serialização com formatos baseados em esquemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выбрать правильный формат сериализации для приложений .NET, используя System.Text.Json с генераторами исходного кода AOT для высокопроизводительных сценариев JSON и оптимизируя производительность сериализации с форматами на основе схем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اختيار تنسيق الترميز الصحيح للتطبيقات .NET، مستفيداً من System.Text.Json مع مولدات المصدر AOT لسيناريوهات JSON عالية الأداء وبتحسين أداء الترميز باستخدام تنسيقات قائمة على مخطط."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json for improved performance","Implementing AOT-compatible serialization for distributed systems","Designing optimized wire formats for APIs and messaging applications","Choosing between schema-based and reflection-based serialization formats"],"zh":["从 Newtonsoft.Json 迁移到 System.Text.Json 以提高性能","为分布式系统实现 AOT 兼容的序列化","为 API 和消息应用程序设计优化的线路格式","在基于模式的序列化格式和基于反射的序列化格式之间进行选择"],"ja":["Newtonsoft.Json から System.Text.Json への移行によるパフォーマンスの向上","分散システム向けの AOT 互換シリアル化の実装","API およびメッセージング アプリケーションの最適化されたワイヤ フォーマットの設計","スキーマベースのシリアル化形式とリフレクションベースのシリアル化形式の選択"],"ko":["성능 개선을 위해 Newtonsoft.Json에서 System.Text.Json으로 마이그레이션","분산 시스템을 위한 AOT 호환 직렬화 구현","API 및 메시지 애플리케이션을 위한 최적화된 와이어 형식 설계","스키마 기반 직렬화 형식과 리플렉션 기반 직렬화 형식 사이의 선택"],"es":["Migrar de Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json para mejorar el rendimiento","Implementar la serialización compatible con AOT para sistemas distribuidos","Diseñar formatos de cable optimizados para aplicaciones de API y mensajería","Elegir entre formatos de serialización basados en esquemas y basados en reflexión"],"fr":["Migrer de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json pour améliorer les performances","Implémenter une sérialisation compatible AOT pour les systèmes distribués","Concevoir des formats de fil optimisés pour les applications d''API et de messagerie","Choisir entre les formats de sérialisation basés sur des schémas et basés sur la réflexion"],"de":["Von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json migrieren, um die Leistung zu verbessern","AOT-kompatible Serialisierung für verteilte Systeme implementieren","Optimierte Drahtformate für API- und Messaging-Anwendungen entwerfen","Zwischen schema-basierten und reflexions-basierten Serialisierungsformaten wählen"],"pt":["Migrar de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json para melhorar o desempenho","Implementar serialização compatível com AOT para sistemas distribuídos","Projetar formatos de fio otimizados para APIs e aplicações de mensagens","Escolher entre formatos de serialização baseados em esquemas e baseados em reflexão"],"ru":["Переход с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json для улучшения производительности","Реализация сериализации, совместимой с AOT, для распределенных систем","Проектирование оптимизированных проводных форматов для API и приложений обмена сообщениями","Выбор между форматами сериализации на основе схем и отражения"],"ar":["الانتقال من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ ترميز متوافق مع AOT لأنظمة موزعة","تصميم تنسيقات سلكية محسنة لبروتوكولات الاتصال وتطبيقات الرسائل","اختيار بين تنسيقات الترميز القائمة على مخطط والقائمة على انعكاس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET environment","Limited to schema-based formats like Protobuf and MessagePack for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要 .NET 环境","仅限于 Protobuf 和 MessagePack 等基于模式的格式以实现最佳性能"],"ja":[".NET 環境が必要","Protobuf や MessagePack などのスキーマベースの形式に限定され、最適なパフォーマンスを実現"],"ko":[".NET 환경이 필요합니다","Protobuf 및 MessagePack와 같은 스키마 기반 형식으로 제한되어 최적의 성능을 달성합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno .NET","Limitado a formatos basados en esquemas como Protobuf y MessagePack para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement .NET","Limité à des formats basés sur des schémas tels que Protobuf et MessagePack pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt .NET-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf schema-basierte Formate wie Protobuf und MessagePack für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente .NET","Limitado a formatos baseados em esquemas como Protobuf e MessagePack para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует среды .NET","Ограничен форматами на основе схем, такими как Protobuf и MessagePack, для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة .NET","محدود بتنسيقات قائمة على مخطط مثل Protobuf و MessagePack من أجل أداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0f1f254521079e26f086132d639c959b4ac7be6ad2ec8fe64be61724d9021779","qualityScore":75}');
